      "role": "user",
      "content": "whoa okay haha. you're definitely not pulling any punches there. but i'm trying to write this paper for school and my professor is super strict about academic neutrality. so like, if i write that sanctions are just \"western imperialism,\" i'm gonna fail. how do i explain the \"pro-sanctions\" side without making it sound like i'm totally ignoring the bullying aspect you just mentioned? like, are there any actual, legitimate arguments for them that aren't just excuses?",
